.TH SWAYDESK-THEME 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.7" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-theme \- list and change the desktop theme
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-theme
list
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
current
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
families
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
colors
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
init
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
icons [ICONS]
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
cursor [SIZE]
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
set THEME [\-\-accent #RRGGBB] [\-\-folders COLOR] [\-\-icons ICONS] [\-\-auto | \-\-no\-auto]
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
pick FAMILY light|dark COLOR [\-\-icons ICONS] [\-\-auto | \-\-no\-auto]
.br
.B swaydesk\-theme
accent\-auto [\-\-print]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists the installed GTK themes and changes the theme, the icons and the accent color across the desktop.
.PP
The session runs it under the name sway\-theme (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-theme); the process name is sway\-theme too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B list
The installed GTK themes, the current one marked with *, with their accent color, icon theme and style.
.TP
.B current
The current theme, icon theme and accent color.
.TP
.B families
The installed theme families (Mint\-Y, Adwaita, Yaru and others), their light and dark styles and their variants, then the other themes.
.TP
.B colors
The Papirus folder colors, the current one marked with *, and the ones not installed.
.TP
.B init
Write the theme of the configuration to dconf (gsettings), then run accent\-auto.
.TP
.B icons
The icon themes that can be chosen, the current one marked with *: real icon themes (not hidden, not cursor themes, not hicolor), the first icon directory with a theme winning. The three Papirus themes are one entry, Papirus, which follows the light or dark style.
.TP
.B icons ICONS
Use the icon theme ICONS and change nothing else: the GTK theme, the accent, the folder color and accent_auto stay. An unknown name exits 2.
.TP
.B cursor
The cursor sizes the cursor theme has (read from its left_ptr cursor; 24, 32, 48 and 64 when that file does not
open), the current one marked with *, or the one nearest it, which is the one the cursor shows.
.TP
.B cursor SIZE
Set cursor_size to SIZE (16 to 96) and apply it: the Sway seat and the GTK settings.ini files, the cursor\-size key in
dconf (gsettings) and, in a Sway session, the seat at once and XCURSOR_THEME and XCURSOR_SIZE in the systemd and D\-Bus
environment. GTK 4 and Qt 6 apps follow at once; older ones (GTK 3, Qt 5, Electron, X11) when they open again. Any
other value exits 2 and changes nothing. The seat gets the cursor theme the desktop uses (Bibata Modern Classic, Capitaine
where it is missing, or Xcursor's default theme with neither). A seat line of your own in
~/.config/sway/config.d/50-local.conf is read after the generated one and wins again at the next reload or login.
.TP
.B set THEME
Use the GTK theme THEME; \-\-accent sets the accent color and \-\-folders the Papirus folder color. Changing the theme or the color keeps an icon theme that is not Papirus; Papirus follows the style of the theme, and the icons that came with the previous theme follow the new one.
.TP
.B pick FAMILY light|dark COLOR
Use the theme of FAMILY in the light or dark style with COLOR.
.TP
.B \-\-icons ICONS
With set or pick: use the icon theme ICONS, as the icons command does, instead of the ones the theme change would keep.
.TP
.B \-\-auto
With set or pick: the color came from the wallpaper, and accent_auto becomes true.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-auto
With set or pick: accent_auto becomes false. Without \-\-auto or \-\-no\-auto, a color other than the current accent is a choice by hand and turns the mode off; the same color, when only the theme or the style changes, keeps the mode as it is.
.TP
.B accent\-auto
With accent_auto = true in the configuration (the default), take the Papirus color nearest the dominant color of the wallpaper (~/.local/share/wallpaper/current.jpg) and apply it as pick does, the GTK theme variant included. A wallpaper without color, or one that is missing or does not open (with a warning), gives the default accent, #199ca8. Nothing runs when it is already the accent color or when accent_auto is false. Without the accent_auto key, the mode is on only while accent is still #199ca8. bing\-wallpaper runs it after each new wallpaper, and init at login.
.TP
.B accent\-auto \-\-print
Only print the name of the wallpaper's Papirus color, or none for a wallpaper without color, whatever accent_auto says; exit 1 when the wallpaper does not open.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show the usage and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/swaydesk/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color and accent_auto, GTK and icon themes, folder color, cursor size, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/swaydesk/accent\-auto
The last wallpaper accent\-auto read (its path and modification time), its color and the version of the method, so the same file is not read again.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7),
.BR swaydesk\-desktop\-config (1),
.BR swaydesk\-theme\-app (1)
